      "jcr:created": "Tue Jul 09 2024 14:58:42 GMT+0000",
      "text": "Emergency medical service You work in a demanding, fast-paced environment. You need durable, powerful, connected devices to help save lives and coordinate teams to deliver the highest quality of care. Solutions for EMS and military Hospitals Equipment you can depend on in that moment when saving a life is the only thing that matters. Intelligent tools monitor, document and review each code event to enhance response the next time. Solutions for hospitals Workplace and public safety Sudden cardiac arrest (SCA) knows no boundaries. Our products and solutions can provide a critical resource to help an EMS first responder—a colleague, a teacher or simply a passerby—save a life. Solutions for public safety Digital healthcare solutions We share your passion for helping patients, so we make it fast and easy to share healthcare data, collaborate and generate insights that help you drive improvements in protocols today—and team performance for tomorrow. Digital healthcare solutions",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jul 09 2024 14:58:48 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/experienceFragment",
      "fragmentPath": "/content/experience-fragments/stryker/emergency-care/en/homepage/solutions/master",
